<title>USA: Safeguard sees Advantage benefit in Q3.</title>
<headline>Safeguard sees Advantage benefit in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Safeguard Health Enterprises Inc said it will realize the full benefit of the Advantage Dental Health Plans acquisition beginning in the third quarter of this year.</p>
<p>It recently completed the acquisition of the Florida acquisition, which adds approximately 125,000 members to the company's existing membership and has contributed to the continued growth of the company.</p>
</text>
